{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:59:36+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T15:59:36+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Línea Directa Aseguradora, S.A., Compañía de Seguros y Reaseguros","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Property & Casualty","country":"Spain","city":"Tres Cantos","website":"https://www.lineadirectaaseguradora.com","employees":2373,"summary":"Línea Directa Aseguradora, S.A., Compañía de Seguros y Reaseguros engages in insurance and reinsurance business in Spain and Portugal. The company operates through Automobiles, Home, Health, Other Insurance, and Other Activities segments. The Automobiles segment offers car, third party, motorcycle, theft, fire, and fleet insurance. The Home Insurance segment offers theft damage, civil liability, fire, aesthetic damage, and anti-squatting insurance. The Health Insurance segment provides health care products Vivaz brands. The Other Insurance segment offers travel assistance for credit card holders, wellness insurance, pet insurance, and multi-risk insurance. It also provides vehicle repair services through telephone and internet sales distribution channels. Línea Directa Aseguradora, S.A. was formerly known as Bankinter Aseguradora Directa, S.A. Compañía de Seguros y Reaseguros and changed its name to Línea Directa Aseguradora, S.A., Compañía de Seguros y Reaseguros in January 1995. Línea Directa Aseguradora, S.A., Compañía de Seguros y Reaseguros was incorporated in 1994 and is based in Tres Cantos, Spain.","exchange":"MCE","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Lnea Directa Aseguradora, S.A., Compaa de Seguros y Reaseguros exerce des activités d'assurance et de réassurance en Espagne et au Portugal. La société opère par le biais des secteurs Automobiles, Maison, Santé, Autres assurances et Autres activités. Le secteur Automobiles propose des assurances auto, tiers, mo